---@param params table * x (number) position relative to the top-left of the parent * y (number) position relative to the top-left of the parent * w (number) width * h (number) height * color (color or function) primary color for the object * pos (function) dynamic position callback returning x, y * size (function) dynamic size callback returning w, h * visible (function) dynamic visibility callback * floating (boolean) keep the object fixed inside a scrollable container, added in 2.11.6, defaults to false * title (string or function) text displayed on the left; function support added in 2.11.6, defaults to an empty string
---@return table
function lvgl.setting(parent, params) end

